It was Shirou who had saved Miyaka when she was on the verge of a mental breakdown
from the beatings and assault she had suffered,
and from that point on he had treated her gently within this room.

As the safety pin was twisted and ground around
while piercing her nipple,
Miyaka let out a tremendous shriek.

Her limbs twitched and convulsed,
while her consciousness seemed all but gone,
her face pitifully rolled back to the whites of her eyes.

At the same time, the tentacle inside her vagina crushed her womb,
while the one forced into her anus tore through the walls of her stomach,
scrambling her insides into a pulverized mess.
